{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878560/extras/38a6b6186556553b3d918bc2ffd43181.avif?t=1756045284\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love. Power. Redemption. Or Ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years on the battlefield, you return home\u2014only to discover your family\u2019s name is poison in the streets. Your father\u2019s betrayal has left the city in chaos, and your loved ones are paying the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a hardened ex-soldier, you must navigate a web of lies, lust, and loyalty in a city that no longer welcomes you. Will you rebuild trust through compassion and romance\u2026 or bend others to your will with dominance and control?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every relationship is a choice. Every choice leads to pleasure\u2014or pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878560/extras/cdc155a59faea7f197a1ed2636685941.poster.avif?t=1756045284\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878560/extras/cdc155a59faea7f197a1ed2636685941.webm?t=1756045284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878560/extras/cdc155a59faea7f197a1ed2636685941.mp4?t=1756045284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1000 Full HD Images</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Lengthy Lewd Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple branching paths and endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ licensed songs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep relationship system: romance, manipulate, or dominate key characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your morality shapes the story: will you be a savior, a sinner, or something in between?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878560/extras/d61abf1e94bff320dc62a26617c18000.poster.avif?t=1756045284\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878560/extras/d61abf1e94bff320dc62a26617c18000.webm?t=1756045284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878560/extras/d61abf1e94bff320dc62a26617c18000.mp4?t=1756045284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore. Seduce. Choose. Rule.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city remembers what your family did. But what will they remember\u00a0<i>you</i>\u00a0for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878560/extras/818ef318506aab973101d846aa54e151.poster.avif?t=1756045284\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878560/extras/818ef318506aab973101d846aa54e151.webm?t=1756045284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878560/extras/818ef318506aab973101d846aa54e151.mp4?t=1756045284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878560?t=1756045284","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.ste